{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國饒舌男歌手P.Diddy（原名Sean Combs）涉嫌性販運、敲詐勒索、涉及賣淫的州際運輸等罪名，去年判監50個月，罰款50萬美元（約390萬港元）。</p><p>上周六（9日）傳出他在獄中受傷，需送院治療的消息，英國《每日郵報》引述知情人士透露，P.Diddy疑因得罪牙買加毒梟Christopher 'Dudus' Coke，二人在獄中毆鬥，P.Diddy頭部重創，幸無性命危險。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:39:48.849942+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:04:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:17:54.388361+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T09:37:42.028489+00:00","content_hash":"4a596da87e7bdc0dfe664dd2d8b040ee1b5329f9256af935f84d3662225b1e85","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}